 "structural_change": "PD-AUDIT C3 (owner 10-21): q9a W/E faces carried 512 bus pins (558 counted) in 127.7 um (4.4/um, 46% of the face). Fix: q10a MAIN = q9a outline 248.40x276.48 + the same 3 free-standing SRAM columns / >=20-um channels; W/E 128-bit buses spread over the full face 5.4..271.08 um (66.4 um each, 1.93 signal pins/um), ordered bottom->top W sx2,sx1,sr2,sr1 / E ur,dp,dr,up so the face-anchored pin flops reach their N-face partners (od_q, ir_q) in <= 387 um (q9 order: up_data 451 um, sr1 419 um). RTL/pins/clock/reset/N-S faces unchanged; zero cycles.",
